5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I worry we are freezing ourselves to save money. The current split feels arbitrary and cold.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Honestly, the math is getting messy. Who is actually doing the calculations every month? It feels like a burden.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The old agreement was for three people. We are five now. I want to know if the current split is fair.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the actual numbers before I agree to anything. The bills have changed significantly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to get along. The money talk is making everyone quiet and sad.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, it is not just math. It is about comfort. I don't want to wear a coat indoors.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I hear you. But if the system is broken, comfort doesn't matter. We need a sustainable process.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Victoria, what specific numbers are you looking for? I am open to looking at the data.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, I need the full year. I need to see the seasonal spikes and the total cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,Can we look at how other houses do it? Maybe there is a simpler way.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, other houses might have different needs. Our rooms are different. Some get sun, some don't.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that is a good point. But we also need to know the cost of changing the system.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We need to check the actual usage in each room. It might not be equal.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the statements. I also want to see if there is a template for reconciliation.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the payment log. I want to see if late payments are causing the tension.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the plug-in monitors. I want to see who is using the most power.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will look at the monthly settle at another house. I want to see how much time it takes.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the sunlight and heating needs. I want to understand the physical differences.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the last twelve utility statements. I need the raw data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will look at the kitchen notice. I want to see if people are avoiding the cooler.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
