60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C seems best. It addresses the usage gap directly. The cost is high, but the fairness is worth it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,I am hesitant about C because of the time. But A is too simple. B is risky. C is the most accurate.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I support C. The data shows the disparity is real. We need to measure it.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I am still worried about the 170,000 yen. But B requires a complex year-end settle. C is cleaner.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,I like C. It feels like everyone pays for what they use. No more guessing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, the annual check is only 3,000 yen. It is manageable. The wiring takes two days.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that is true. But who does the logging? I don't want it to be me every month.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, we can rotate it. Or use an app. The other house took forty minutes, but that was manual.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, the app might help. But I still think the upfront cost is a barrier.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,We can split the upfront cost. It is an investment in our peace.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I agree with Minato. It is an investment. I am voting for C.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,I am voting for C. I will try to find a way to make the logging easier.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am voting for C. The data supports it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am voting for C. The seasonal swings are too big for B, and A is unfair.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am voting for C. I want us to get along.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we are all in agreement. C is the way to go.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mio,,Yes. Let's do it. I will look into apps for the logging.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,Good. I will help with the setup.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I will handle the financial planning for the upfront cost.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minato,,Thank you. I am glad we are doing this.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
